{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:accessibility:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/defaultSize"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"role":"symbol","title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Variants","anchor":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Track","anchor":"Track"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Helper text","anchor":"Helper-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"code":"\"75 %\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"code":"\"٪75\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                  helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]","type":"text"}]},{"text":". Example: ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that assistive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technologies know the value is changing.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic ","type":"text"},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trait is used.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver (","type":"text"},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — and therefore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Colored surfaces","anchor":"Colored-surfaces"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Version","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"m